'''Setsuko''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that could be obtained from the [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event|Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 265
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Setsuko
|name2 = Setsuko Love Mackerel
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Setsuko Love Mackerel''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Setsuko has the stats of a generalist, but, unlike Nyamusu, is nothing but downgrades from [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and is, therefore, only truly good for [[User Rank]]. He can be really strong in early [[Empire of Cats]] and his 30% chance to knockback Red enemies can be useful until [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cat]] is obtained, but he won't have much going for him after [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]]'s first defeat.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

